123 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 74 0 R
/E (Traditional assistive wearables are locked behind a $1000 - $3000 monopoly. By utilizing off-the-shelf commodity hardware and a modular software stack, Asirive achieves a 90% cost reduction \(SGD 250 BOM\). This allows us to scale rapidly into the medical market without the high manufacturing barriers of custom silicon)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
124 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 74 0 R
/T (Most startups fail by relying 100% on cloud AI. Asirive uses a 'Layered Safety' model. Immediate hazard detection runs locally on the edge \(Hailo-8L\), while complex reasoning is pushed to the cloud \(Gemini\). This ensures the product remains functional in high-density, GPS-dead zones like VivoCity or MRT stations where competitors fail)
/E (Most startups fail by relying 100% on cloud AI. Asirive uses a 'Layered Safety' model. Immediate hazard detection runs locally on the edge \(Hailo-8L\), while complex reasoning is pushed to the cloud \(Gemini\). This ensures the product remains functional in high-density, GPS-dead zones like VivoCity or MRT stations where competitors fail)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
