/Title (The assistive tech market forces the visually impaired to choose between their white cane and a smartphone. Asirive Cortex shatters this bottleneck. We engineered a hands-free, distributed wearable that processes physical reality at the speed the user walks. By separating local edge-compute \(for instant physical hazard detection\) from cloud-based reasoning, Cortex delivers true navigation independence without the premium price tag)
